msgstr "Calea lui %s ar fi prea lungă."

#: title/pc5_files.c:319
#, c-format
msgid "PC5 can't find a free name for %s."
msgstr "PC5 nu găsește un nume liber pentru %s."

#: title/pc5_files.c:351
#, c-format
msgid "There isn't room: it needs %s and the drive has %s free."
msgstr "Nu e destul loc: e nevoie de %s, iar unitatea are %s liberi."

